  "bodyHash": "10b73d6a11842c5a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">Fabric？<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boatoverhaul-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組將 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fworldofwarships.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">WOWS</a> 的船隻航行機制移植至 Minecraft。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>功能特色：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">修改了 4 個原版快捷鍵：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">前進 (W)：向前航行 -&gt; 船隻升檔；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">後退 (S)：向後航行 -&gt; 船隻降檔；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">向左橫移 (A)：船隻左轉 -&gt; 船舵左轉（手動）；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">向右橫移 (D)：船隻右轉 -&gt; 船舵右轉（手動）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">新增 2 個模組快捷鍵：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">NUM4：船舵左轉（自動）；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">NUM6：船舵右轉（自動）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>展示：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/665/boatoverhaul_gear.gif\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">船隻會逐漸升檔。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/666/boatoverhaul-rudder.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">船隻向左轉舵，並進行升檔與降檔。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>設定檔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">.minecraft/config/boatoverhaul-common.toml (Forge)</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">#允許船隻在檔位處於停止時，以極低的額外前進速度轉動船舵</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">allowRudderingWhenStopped</span> = <span style=\"color:#36f\">false</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808000;font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">#若設為 true，例如船隻向後航行並向右轉舵時，會向左後方移動</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#800080\">reverseRudderWhenSailingAstern</span> = <span style=\"color:#36f\">false</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\"><strong>注意事項：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組的音效資源來自熱門海戰遊戲 WOWS；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">此模組的「不含 Mixin」版本需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mixinbootstrap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MixinBootstrap</a>。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入你的整合包中；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">我<span style=\"color:#f60\"><strong>歡迎</strong></span>針對合適版本／模組載入器的移植請求。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
